  "McpServerDialog": {
    "\nRestart {0} for it to take effect.": "\n重启 {0} 以使其生效。",
    "\nThen mention KhervePaint in your chat with {0} — say {1}in KhervePaint, draw a flowchart{1} — and it will draw in this document.": "\n然后在与 {0} 的对话中提到 KhervePaint——说 {1}在 KhervePaint 中，画一个流程图{1}——它就会在此文档中绘图。",
    " &nbsp; HTTP: {0}": " &nbsp; HTTP：{0}",
    " It can read and overwrite files anywhere you can, so connect only applications you trust.": " 它可以在您有权限的任何位置读取和覆盖文件，因此请只连接您信任的应用程序。",
    "<b style='color:#2e7d32'>Listening</b> on 127.0.0.1:{0}{1}<br>endpoint file: {2}": "<b style='color:#2e7d32'>正在监听</b> 127.0.0.1:{0}{1}<br>端点文件：{2}",
    "<b style='color:#b71c1c'>Stopped</b> — no assistant can reach this drawing.": "<b style='color:#b71c1c'>已停止</b> — 没有助手可以访问此绘图。",
    "<b>Could not open a local port.</b> Another process may be holding it.": "<b>无法打开本地端口。</b>可能已被其他进程占用。",
    "<b>Then say &quot;KhervePaint&quot; in the chat.</b> Claude only reaches for this document when you point it here &mdash; <i>&quot;in KhervePaint, draw a flowchart of the login process&quot;</i>. After that it carries on in the open document.<br><br>Restart the application after connecting &mdash; it reads its tool list once at startup &mdash; and leave KhervePaint running with the box above ticked.": "<b>然后在聊天中说「KhervePaint」。</b>只有当您在对话中指明时，Claude 才会使用此文档 &mdash; 例如<i>「在 KhervePaint 中，画一个登录流程的流程图」</i>。之后它会继续在已打开的文档中操作。<br><br>连接后请重启应用程序 &mdash; 它只在启动时读取一次工具列表 &mdash; 并让 KhervePaint 保持运行，勾选上面的复选框。",
    "Cannot be edited automatically.": "无法自动编辑。",
    "Choose the client's MCP config file": "选择客户端的 MCP 配置文件",
    "Claude Code (command line)": "Claude Code（命令行）",
    "Claude Desktop / Cursor / Zed (JSON)": "Claude Desktop / Cursor / Zed（JSON）",
    "Connect": "连接",
    "Connect an application": "连接一个应用",
    "Connect to Claude": "连接到 Claude",
    "Copy": "复制",
    "Disconnect": "断开连接",
    "Draw, restyle, arrange, place models — and save over the open file, but not open or write another one.": "绘制、重新设置样式、排列、放置模型——并覆盖保存当前打开的文件，但不能打开或写入其他文件。",
    "Edit": "编辑",
    "Everything, including opening and writing files it names itself, so 'open my flowchart and add a step' works in one go.": "一切操作，包括打开和写入它自己指定的文件，因此「打开我的流程图并添加一个步骤」这类请求可以一次完成。",
    "File: {0}": "文件：{0}",
    "Full (recommended)": "完全（推荐）",
    "JSON config (*.json);;All files (*)": "JSON 配置文件 (*.json);;所有文件 (*)",
    "Let Claude draw in this document directly — no API key, it uses the login you already have. Works with <b>Claude Desktop</b> and <b>Claude Code</b>, and with Cursor, Cline, VS Code and LM Studio.<br><br>Claude gets the whole app rather than a chat reply: shapes, the symbol palettes, the molecule and crystal builders, and a look at the canvas to check its own work. Everything it does is undoable with Ctrl+Z.": "让 Claude 直接在此文档中绘图——无需 API 密钥，使用您已有的登录。支持 <b>Claude Desktop</b> 和 <b>Claude Code</b>，以及 Cursor、Cline、VS Code 和 LM Studio。<br><br>Claude 获得的是整个应用，而不只是一句聊天回复：图形、符号库、分子与晶体构建器，还能查看画布以核对自己的工作。它所做的一切都可以用 Ctrl+Z 撤销。",
    "Let assistants connect to this document": "允许助手连接到此文档",
    "Look at the drawing and highlight items; no changes.": "查看绘图并高亮元素；不作任何更改。",
    "Or set it up by hand:": "或手动设置：",
    "Other application…": "其他应用……",
    "Pick yours and press Connect — KhervePaint writes itself into that application's own settings, so there is no config file to edit by hand.": "选择您的应用并点击「连接」——KhervePaint 会自动写入该应用自己的设置，无需手动编辑配置文件。",
    "Point at another assistant's JSON config file and add KhervePaint to it.": "指向另一个助手的 JSON 配置文件，将 KhervePaint 添加进去。",
    "Previous version saved as {0}": "先前版本已保存为 {0}",
    "Read only": "只读",
    "Recent activity": "最近活动",
    "Remove KhervePaint from {0}'s configuration?\nOther servers are left untouched.": "要从 {0} 的配置中移除 KhervePaint 吗？\n其他服务器不受影响。",
