    "URL      {0}\nTransport  Streamable HTTP (POST JSON-RPC)\nHeader   Authorization: Bearer {1}\n\nFor clients that take an endpoint rather than a command —\nOpen WebUI, n8n, and some IDE setups. The token changes\nevery time the server is switched on, so re-copy it after\nrestarting KhervePaint.\n\n127.0.0.1 only: this is not reachable from another machine,\nand cloud assistants (ChatGPT, Le Chat, Grok) cannot use it.": "URL      {0}\n传输方式  Streamable HTTP（POST JSON-RPC）\n请求头   Authorization: Bearer {1}\n\n适用于使用端点而非命令的客户端——\nOpen WebUI、n8n 以及一些 IDE 配置。令牌在每次\n启动服务器时都会改变，因此重启 KhervePaint 后\n请重新复制。\n\n仅限 127.0.0.1：无法从其他机器访问，\n云端助手（ChatGPT、Le Chat、Grok）也无法使用。",
